# Quality and Safety

## Current journey status

Represent Water Writes the Landscape as a prototype and Field-Test Draft. It may advance only to Approved for Private Adult Co-Design Walk in the demo.

Never imply park approval, legal approval, insurance coverage, public youth-program readiness, or scientific expert certification.

## Safety fields

Every journey stop should support route risk, prohibited actions, accessibility alternative, weather constraint, emergency note, technology-failure fallback, and reviewer status.

## Privacy

Show what is saved, whether a note is private or mentor-visible, whether it enters an artifact, and that service data is not automatically research data.

Do not implement public-sharing dark patterns.

## Quality review

Include learning design, factual integrity, sources, safety, accessibility, adult field test, learner pilot, maintenance date, and unresolved issues.

## Truthfulness

- label mock analytics
- label deterministic AI
- report incomplete features honestly
- do not fabricate integration
- do not claim production readiness
